WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.260
In Britain, Daphne Hampson once
campaigned for women to become priests.

2
00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:08.330
Later, she left Christianity altogether.

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.960
So did the theologian Mary Daly.

4
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.640
Both were theologians who had studied
and taught Christian thought for years.

5
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:20.620
Others, like Rosemary Radford Ruether,
stayed in the Church to change it.

6
00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:24.590
So why did some feminists
decide they had to leave?

7
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:28.930
In this mission, you'll read a famous
verse about men and women in Christ,

8
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.310
and ask how much it can carry.

9
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.600
Then you'll compare three
thinkers on one question:

10
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:38.430
is patriarchy a stain,
or part of the structure?

11
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.050
Your mission: find out why some
feminists stayed to change the Church,

12
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.400
while others decided they had to leave.
